cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "AI Signals Daily — daily AI signals dataset (Signals 4)"
abstract: >-
  A daily machine-written dataset of AI signals collected from public sources: one item per core
  source per day (GitHub trending repos, Hugging Face models, arXiv papers, YouTube talks and
  Silicon Valley news), each linking to the original. Published automatically every day by
  Signals 4, a free daily AI digest. Derived rankings and momentum numbers are recomputed from
  the raw snapshots and reconciled with the site by an automated audit.
type: dataset
authors:
  # 必须是 CFF 的「entity」形式：允许 name/website/alias…，不允许 family-names（那是 person 形式）
  # 混用两种形式会被官方 schema 判为不通过（2026-09-15 由 external standards 校验抓到）
  - name: "Signals 4 (Signals API)"
    website: "https://data.jiangzhang.ca/signals4/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jiangzhangcc-glitch/ai-signals-daily"
url: "https://data.jiangzhang.ca/signals4/archive/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
